#Davu-prep.lic
#Ranger version of Brayis-prep.lic (Davu) -- kept as basic as possible: the
#small statue / white crystal / black crystal rubs and no scroll spell-up
#(ewaggle runs in Davu-prerest instead). Replaces the profiles' plain
#"ready weapon" hunting prep.
#
#The ipantor long bow lives slung over his shoulder: STORE WEAPON slings it,
#READY WEAPON slings it off into the left hand (both verified in his 11/02 log).

module DavuPrep

# clear hands -- "store weapon" slings the bow first, so "stow all" only mops
# up whatever else is in a hand (a bow can't fire with the right hand full).
fput "store weapon"
fput "stow all"

# rub stuff, but only if the spell isn't already active -- and only pause
# after ones that actually ran, instead of always eating 3s per item
unless Spell[1712].active?
  Script.run("qverb", "rub small statue")
  pause 3
end
unless Spell[509].active?
  Script.run("qverb", "rub white crystal")
  pause 3
end
# black crystal = Floating Disk; skip it when his disk is already here
unless GameObj.loot.find { |i| i.name =~ /#{Char.name} disk/ }
  Script.run("qverb", "rub black crystal")
  pause 3
end

fput "ready weapon"

# Still nothing in either hand: the bow is really gone (disarmed and never
# recovered, or the STORE weapon setting points at something that isn't
# there). Don't let bigshot walk back out unarmed -- stop it here, in town,
# the same way Brayis-prep.lic does. This runs before any travel (bigshot's
# hunting_prep_commands happen at the start of pre_hunt).
pause 0.5
if checkright.nil? && checkleft.nil?
  echo "Davu-prep: nothing in hand after READY WEAPON -- stopping bigshot. " \
       "Check the STORE weapon setting (STORE LIST)."
  Script.kill("bigshot") if Script.running?("bigshot")
  exit
end

# Puts away loot eloot has no room for and unpauses it, so a full container
# can't leave you fighting with your hands full (see eloot_guard.lic).
Script.start("eloot_guard") unless Script.running?("eloot_guard")

end #End of module
